{
    "background_story": "In the mystical realm of Aethoria, Bentley was a rare and majestic Tolmiea, a creature with the body of a deer and the wings of a butterfly. Tolmieas were known for their extraordinary beauty and Bentley was no exception. His coat shimmered in hues of iridescent blue and green, while his wings danced with delicate, swirling patterns. Bentley lived in harmony with the land, using his Tolmiea magic to heal the wounded earth and bring balance to the ecosystem. His home, the Crystal Caves, was a sanctuary for all creatures, and Bentley was its loyal guardian. With his Tolmiea senses, he could detect even the slightest disturbance in the natural world, and he would fiercely defend his domain against any threat. Bentley's legend grew as a symbol of hope and protection, inspiring generations of Aethorians to respect and preserve the natural world.",
